      "id": "7f3ea3da7ae944c6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9190,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**乡村振兴**"
    },
    {
      "id": "424e8ce7b6ca45a6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9190,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**二、东南亚国家的关税调整与供应链转移承接**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b30b53074024c15",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9190,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**二、人口增长率提高对稳态的影响（图20-8）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1bff0b02ecb4486",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -9080,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**二、现代经济增长理论的特征（图片2）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e26f548577c84ba2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -9080,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**二、选择性保护政策类型及特点**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9e8ff8a70264baf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -9080,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**五、举例说明（数字化示例）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cf1f6aa79b4c4390",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8970,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**五、理论意义与应用（补充图片3内容）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "af14a92502554d2a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8970,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**五、选择性保护下的问题与挑战**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad1a5ed9891e42a8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8970,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**产业结构迅速升级：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c19cbd35ae4c4942",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8860,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**产量水平：$Q_0$ 与 $Q_1$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "28e583cacfa24b8a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8860,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人口增长抵消了收入增长**"
    },
    {
      "id": "978d0b3750804e02",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8860,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人口增长率$n$、技术进步率（此处先假设为零）和折旧率$\\delta$均为外生变量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fec92bdfc2ca4120",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8750,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人口增长率$n$提高：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "aedd3fe449eb49c2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8750,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人口增长率的增加降低了稳态水平的人均资本和人均产出**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1a65204b5714d7f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8750,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**人均产出迅速增长**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0ec69d46ae241de",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8640,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**从需求变动看地租如何产生**"
    },
    {
      "id": "5cbb9d59af11475a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8640,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**以牙还牙**"
    },
    {
      "id": "df67096b1e484c66",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8640,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**价格水平：$P_0$ 与 $P_1$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8cab5fc2ece344ad",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8530,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**企业对政府保护的依赖与腐败风险:**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2f26fdc8a5cc4d08",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8530,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**传统农业部门**"
    },
    {
      "id": "674e71fe628146b5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8530,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**佐证观点的数据与经济学解释**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd9d5fe71ff34322",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8420,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**作为衡量产业成败的试金石。韩国政府明确要求受保护企业努力出口，否则将撤销支持 ；台湾则是因内需有限，被迫积极拓展外销市场。这使得东亚国家建立了强大的出口部门。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4456451ebae4479",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8420,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**供给曲线：呈阶梯状或分段水平的“粮食供给曲线”**"
    },
    {
      "id": "54fce51f4c4a4797",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8420,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**供给量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e0f0423cb94649eb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8310,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**保留**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7647359e3ac4467",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8310,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**保证增长率$G_W = Vs$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd7d1bbb760049df",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8310,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**倒U形曲线：人口增长率随人均收入变化的关系**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c46f0d6d8ec44190",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8200,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**停战止损**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8071030f0b694f11",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8200,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**储蓄率$s$提高：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "04a071d3a3454255",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8200,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**储蓄率增加仅导致稳态产出水平一次性提高，但长期增长率并未改变**"
    },
    {
      "id": "85c0da06c8474511",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -8090,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**储蓄率提升**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b072005f60ce4f2a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -8090,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**储蓄率的提高提升了稳态的人均资本水平和人均产出水平**"
    },
    {
      "id": "614e2a8ff9c84e15",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -8090,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**僵持期**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2f7e1d0d82614ce3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7980,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**允许人民币贬值**"
    },
    {
      "id": "19725c8f3fd74362",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7980,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**全球供应链与产业转移效应**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ec7c362aadd41af",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7980,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**全球供应链并未与中国真正脱钩**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1f33fb6c75249a5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7870,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**全面保护主义**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6af1a9a9eec48df",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7870,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**六、与拉美ISI策略的比较：选择性保护 vs 全面保护**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb2e2877e0964531",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7870,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**六、经济含义总结**"
    },
    {
      "id": "68e9fb228f214cca",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7760,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
