      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7430,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**出口导向转型阶段（1960年代）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d08a1ef4716457e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7430,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**出口管制**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e576ea0f079f4307",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7320,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**刚投入生产的边际土地**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9ac2a50db484e3e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -7320,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**初始均衡：需求曲线$d_0$与供给曲线交于$(Q_0, P_0)$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd4126318b304053",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -7320,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**制度、观念与意识形态的调整是技术进步和经济增长实现的重要条件**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2daf5779fb3460b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -7210,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**前三最重要**"
