      "x": 141,
      "y": -6990,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**四、图形理解（图片中的图示）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "701ba5cd7b2b4ff4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6880,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**四、提高经济弹性和维护出口竞争力的策略分析**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c20dbb89d148f5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6880,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**四、政策效果分析：产业升级与经济腾飞**"
    },
    {
      "id": "38333b3541a24a28",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6880,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**国家投资大型项目+引进外资技术+扶植民营升级**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1a34c15460f4ad1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6770,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**国有企业**"
    },
    {
      "id": "49a1f02cf62e49fa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6770,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**国际经济扩张迅速**"
    },
    {
      "id": "5d81c4ad13254ae4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6770,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**图1：美中关税争端间接促成的出口增量（“谁受益？”）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cd97cd1ccb8146b8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6660,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**土地改革**"
    },
    {
      "id": "02a4be589f154638",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6660,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**在拉美较为缺乏：许多拉美工业由于政治原因被长期保护，即使效率低下仍难以触动，拖累了整体经济。也有学者指出，东亚国家政府**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7572fe019a5145ca",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6660,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**地租来自于土地肥力（或资源禀赋）的差异**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9276949451334347",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6550,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**培育—竞争—升级**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b14d1ac95ed14c50",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6550,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**大幅提高报复关税和管制战略物资出口**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b05f1dc2d06b4bf9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6550,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**大范围商品清单**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a86ec4cd6d34aec",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6440,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**大豆对华出口当年同比暴跌约75%**"
    },
    {
      "id": "929a03d358d14702",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6440,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**大豆贸易**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ab6f99b607b4181",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6440,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**定向信贷**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c71d210554854385",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6330,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**实际新增购买几乎为零**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbe6ac7327fc479a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6330,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对中国商品征收超高关税**"
    },
    {
      "id": "207cb1ca38164147",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6330,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对出口企业给予进口投入品免税、退税、出口所得减免税50%等优惠**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7059eb7d02e4f2b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6220,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对北美及其他贸易伙伴的新关税措施**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6bc6163dae7487e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6220,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对等关税公式及其变化**"
    },
    {
      "id": "36ab3bcfd7fb4217",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6220,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对等同步**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7dd67807792e4808",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6110,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**对等报复升级**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ddf60555ab34490",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6110,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**局部保护争取时间，全面竞争提升效率**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d240696e90454c08",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6110,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业增加值占GDP比重**"
    },
    {
      "id": "6f8c555aa90b4360",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -6000,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业工资固定**"
    },
    {
      "id": "276a48c119d64b5b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -6000,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**工业革命后的英国**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa2cda08fd9b4192",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -6000,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**差异化处理**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7bb19f6320c748ff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5890,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**市场价格由边际土地决定**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae57ab070f274441",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5890,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**市场反应及经济影响**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c8376c74e35495a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5890,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**并非不可克服**"
    },
    {
      "id": "77c6f7efa0ee498c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5780,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**引言**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4d0035878fa4aa3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5780,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**引言 (Introduction)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a5971f9696b4f5e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5780,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**强化市场机制**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e2c6ff0ab4e4b04",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5670,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**成果对比：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7dc5fb9fded468b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5670,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**所有肥沃土地**"
    },
