      "id": "9181acb30c834747",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5560,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**技术进步**"
    },
    {
      "id": "50c1e5320d1a4699",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5560,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**技术进步是经济增长的基础和源泉**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a8cc71704ca44fe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5450,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**技术进步的作用**"
    },
    {
      "id": "70ff5cc42fc24443",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5450,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**技术进步的重要性**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f679add12feb48b0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5450,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**投资与产业影响**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b033a59f5ff54c32",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5340,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**拉美传统ISI的教训**"
    },
    {
      "id": "54915f6041a2416e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -5340,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**政府指导投资与信贷：国家通过五年计划等手段选择战略产业**"
    },
    {
      "id": "364890a1b2dc4e1c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5340,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**政策覆盖范围：拉美国家（如巴西、阿根廷、墨西哥）在中期采用的ISI往往对几乎所有制造业**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a8970d6b6c74ac7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5230,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**新一轮关税政策的核心数据**"
    },
